---
import '../components/fashion.css';

// Static mocks for the limited-time badges. Tile markup mirrors Tile() in
// fashion-island.tsx so the real .tile styles apply cleanly.
// Expired states are mocked: all live catalog entries are currently attainable.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Limited badge mocks · Classic Closet</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--txt);
        font: 400 14px/1.5 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px 20px 64px; }
      h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .sub { color: var(--dim); margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 13px; }
      .sub code { color: var(--txt); font-size: 12px; }
      section.mock {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        background: var(--surface);
        padding: 16px;
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      section.mock h2 { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 2px; }
      section.mock h2 .tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 10px;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        margin-left: 8px;
        vertical-align: 1px;
        color: var(--dim);
      }
      section.mock h2 .tag.live { color: #ffb020; border-color: #ffb020; }
      section.mock h2 .tag.mocked { color: #7dd3fc; border-color: #7dd3fc; }
      .demo { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 20px; margin: 12px 0; }
      .demo figure { margin: 0; text-align: center; }
      .demo figcaption { font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 6px; }
      .demo .tile { cursor: default; }
      .demo .tile:active { transform: none; }
      ul.why { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 18px; color: var(--dim); font-size: 13px; }
      ul.why li { margin: 2px 0; }
      ul.why strong { color: var(--txt); font-weight: 600; }
      /* Legend badges: standalone copies of the tile-badge styles (no .tile ancestor). */
      .legend { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }
      .legend-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); }
      .legend-row strong { color: var(--txt); font-weight: 600; }
      .legend-swatch { flex: none; width: 72px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; }
      .lg-badge {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 5px;
        background: var(--bg); color: var(--dim); border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }
      .lg-badge svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; flex: none; }
      .lg-clock-amber { background: #ffb020; border-color: #ffb020; color: #1a1200; }
      .lg-clock-red { background: #ff8a80; border-color: #ff8a80; color: #2a0500; }
      .lg-rate {
        font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.72); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.22);
        border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; line-height: 1.5; white-space: nowrap;
      }
      footer { color: var(--dim); font-size: 12px; margin-top: 24px; }
      footer a { color: var(--accent); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Limited badge mocks</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        What the limited-time badges look like in each state, and what each one means.
        Tiles use the real <code>.tile</code> styles. “Live” states exist in the app today;
        “mocked” states preview the expired look (no past-rotation items in the catalog yet).
      </p>

      {/* 1 — Limited active, mystery */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Limited · active <span class="tag live">Live</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
                <span class="tile-rate-badge">16.7%</span>
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Innocent Gaze</span>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <div class="tile mini" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption>rail tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>Solid amber clock</strong> = limited rotation, still available. Dates live in the group header.</li>
          <li><strong>Clock + 16.7%</strong> reads as mystery: random pick, this chance per coupon.</li>
          <li>Live example: Hair / Face drawers → Mystery group (style-oct26 banner).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 2 — Limited active, signature */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Limited · active, you-pick <span class="tag live">Live</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods">
                    <span class="tile-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m3 2 10 6-5 1-2 5-3-12Z" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20006.png" alt="" />
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Babyface Pout</span>
              <em class="rate">Signature</em>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>Cursor</strong> = you pick this exact style (no % badge).</li>
          <li>Same solid amber clock: still limited — it leaves when the rotation ends.</li>
          <li>Live example: Hair / Face drawers → Signature group.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 3 — Limited expired */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Limited · expired / past rotation <span class="tag mocked">Mocked</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile not-attainable" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration expired"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Innocent Gaze</span>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <div class="tile mini not-attainable" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration expired"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption>rail tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>Solid red clock + dimmed tile</strong> = rotation over, preview only.</li>
          <li>Hover/long-press reveals “Last available 08-15 – 09-15” (beta-style-sep26).</li>
          <li>Mocked: no expired items in the catalog yet — this is what they’ll look like.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 4 — 10-day cover */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Limited · 10-day cover <span class="tag live">Live</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods">
                    <span class="tile-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m3 2 10 6-5 1-2 5-3-12Z" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></span>
                  </div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <span style="font-size: 18px">🧢</span>
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Goggled Black Cap</span>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>Cursor + amber clock</strong>: you pick it, but the sale is limited.</li>
          <li>The tooltip reads <strong>“10-day duration · sale ends Nov 18”</strong> — the sale is limited AND the item lasts 10 days.</li>
          <li>Live example: equip drawers → 10-Day Covers group.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 5 — Permanent */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Permanent · no badge <span class="tag">No badge</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <span style="font-size: 18px">⛑️</span>
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Brown Skullcap</span>
              <em class="rate">Lv. 5 · All classes</em>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>No clock, no cursor</strong> = classic equip, always obtainable in-game.</li>
          <li>The sub-line shows level/class instead of a rate — that’s the tell.</li>
          <li>Live example: any equip drawer → Job Equips group.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* 6 — Equipped */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Equipped · worn limited tile <span class="tag live">Live</span></h2>
        <div class="demo">
          <figure>
            <div class="tile on" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
                <span class="tile-rate-badge">16.7%</span>
              </div>
              <span class="tile-label">Innocent Gaze</span>
            </div>
            <figcaption>drawer tile, worn</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <div class="tile mini on" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="tile-preview">
                <div class="tile-badges">
                  <div class="tile-methods"></div>
                  <span class="tile-badge tile-expiration"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span>
                </div>
                <img src="/sprites/faces/20033.png" alt="" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <figcaption>rail tile, worn</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <ul class="why">
          <li><strong>Amber border + tint + check</strong> = equipped on your character.</li>
          <li>The check keeps its corner; the clock drops below it and turns <strong>outline</strong> so the two amber marks stay distinct.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* Legend */}
      <section class="mock">
        <h2>Badge legend</h2>
        <div class="legend">
          <div class="legend-row">
            <span class="legend-swatch"><span class="lg-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m3 2 10 6-5 1-2 5-3-12Z" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg></span></span>
            <span><strong>Cursor</strong> — you pick the exact style (signature coupon, stamp shop, covers).</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-row">
            <span class="legend-swatch"><span class="lg-badge lg-clock-amber"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span></span>
            <span><strong>Amber clock</strong> — limited rotation, still available. Dates in the group header + Rotation info.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-row">
            <span class="legend-swatch"><span class="lg-badge lg-clock-red"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8 4v4l3 2" stroke-linecap="round" /></svg></span></span>
            <span><strong>Red clock + dimmed tile</strong> — rotation ended. Preview only, not attainable.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="legend-row">
            <span class="legend-swatch"><span class="lg-rate">2.5%</span></span>
            <span><strong>% pill</strong> — chance per random pull. Clock + % reads as mystery.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer>
        Mocks page — not linked from the app. Back to the <a href="/">closet</a>.
      </footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
